# Old project URLs, kept alive.
#
# The label tool has been renamed twice — greenway-label-automator, then
# patient-label-printer, now greenway-label-printer — and the page slug follows
# the project each time. Without these, anything that linked to an earlier name
# lands on the 404 page instead of the thing it was pointing at.
#
# Every rule here names an exact path, and none of them is a catch-all. That is
# deliberate: Cloudflare follows redirect rules "regardless of whether or not an
# asset matches the incoming request", so a /* rule in this file would shadow
# every real page on the site rather than only the missing ones.

/projects/greenway-label-automator   /projects/greenway-label-printer/   301
/projects/greenway-label-automator/  /projects/greenway-label-printer/   301
/projects/patient-label-printer      /projects/greenway-label-printer/   301
/projects/patient-label-printer/     /projects/greenway-label-printer/   301
